{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43196","headline":"题沈黎城 · 权彻","name":"题沈黎城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苏子卧北海，马翁渡南洲。\n迹恨事乃立，功达名遂休。\n夜闻羽书至，召募此边州。\n铁骑燿楚甲，玉匣横吴钩。\n雪厚羣山冻，蓬飞荒塞秋。\n久戍曷辞苦，数战期封侯。\n不学竖儒辈，谈经空白头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权彻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43196.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43196","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}